GLOBAL NON-NEGOTIABLES (DO NOT BREAK)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

- DO NOT alter any verified-correct math (RS Trilaciclib 
  0.503/0.432/0.109/1.043 g; Epinephrine amounts; EI per-element formula once 
